    "body": "That strategy does sound reasonable, although I wonder if you should merge the algorithm with \"try to scroll to the fragment\" so that they're not competing with each other. Again, I wonder what you do in Chromium; do you have two separate periodic polling algorithms running, one for fragment and one for scroll containers? Or just one?",
